03/07/99

   o ZMailer - Any crashes related to Miami and OwnDevUnit (i.e. in Miami
       click Dial, Cancel, Dial and watch ZMailer crash) should be fixed.
       Miami appears to have a buggy OwnDevUnit implementation, where it
       will tell programs that the device is free for use, but will go and
       allocate it anyway. ZMailer will try to work its way out of the mess
       by freeing OwnDevUnit and waiting again, but if it does not succeed
       it will exit gracefully.
