******************* Zeus 1.2 Fixed Feature Set **********************

13/07/99

   o MsgControl - New WriteMsg argument NOEXE which disables running the message
       area executable on it.
   o PostMsg - New argument, TAG, for a FidoNet (or other FTN area) echo tag.
       AREA is not required now if TAG is given.  TAG is a keyword argument
