   o MsgControl, mb#? - Updated maximum message area number to 4Gig, but it's
       not tested...  HighPointer info is still limited to areas less than
       32000.

15/07/99

   o MsgControl - New ARexx command, FindMsgAreaTag.  Returns in Result the
       area number of a given FTN tag name.  If you use AreaChange.zeus,
       change the READ command on line 20 to remove MaxLen and Opts, and the
       "otherwise do" part of the main loop (around line 77) to read as
       follows:

        otherwise do
            got = 0
            if datatype( NewArea ) = 'NUM' then do
               ChangeMsgArea NewArea
               if RC = 0 then
                  got = 1
            end

            if got = 0 then do
               FindMsgAreaTag '"'NewArea'"'
               if RC = 0 then do
                  ChangeMsgArea RESULT
                  if RC = 0 then
                     got = 1
               end
            end

            if got = 0 then Write '"\nInvalid area!\n"'
            NextScript 'Messages/MessagesMenu'
            exit
            end

       You may need to alter the NextScript and exit parts to match your
       existing script.

