       rescanning system has already had.

04/04/00

   o Lines - Started adding support for dial/ring back (ring once, hang up
       for 10s, ring back to make Zeus answer).  This is enabled by the
       Access section of the Lines preferences, so that you can set times
       for it - e.g. run normally during the night but ringback during the
       day.

05/04/00

   o ZMailer - Wrote code for dialback.  To get ZMailer to answer the
       phone, the user must RING once, wait not less than 10 and not more
       than 20 seconds then call back and Zeus will answer the phone.

