01/05/00

   o ANSI - Disabled the code to 'shift' output by 0x80.  It now isn't
       a 100% ANSI emulation, but you'll no longer get the screen turning
       to garbage after some corrupt message goes past.

05/05/00

   o ZMailer - Finally re-enabled the ZMailer log listview, after writing
       the necessary assembler.

08/05/00

   o FileManager - New menu item: Bulk Moved Upload.  Same as Bulk Upload,
       but always deletes the original file (with Bulk Upload, the
       original is renamed to the destination only when on the same
       partition).  This is amazingly useful when you have a
       Mail:Inbound/ with half a gigabyte (!) of files to add to the BBS.

13/05/00

   o ZNewsXfer - Finally found the bug causing the string repetition!  A
       simple termination bug, hidden away in a state machine.  You now
       have one of the best NNTP download clients I know of ;-)
   o ZNewsXfer - Fixed the CtrlC crash bug.
   o ZNewsXfer - Added return code 20 (fail) for severe failure.

15/05/00

