   o ZNewsXfer - Was setting the 'last collection date' file before
       collecting news.  This meant that if you had a crash while
       collecting, you'd lose messages.  Now it's set after collecting
       so you only get dupes (which are killed by ZGate or ZMP).

21/05/00

   o ZNewsXfer - Crashed when getting a non-okay result code when
