27/08/00

   o ZMP - It seems that the UNPACK and PACK directories should be
       different.  Normally, they are (they default to Inbound: and
       Outbound:) but often they get set to T:.  Now ZMP will autocreate
       any specified directories so you can use "T:unpack" and
       "T:pack"..  Auto-directory creation will be added to most other
       path options too.

31/08/00

   o ZMPstat - Added "compact" mode, similar to the more usual single
