17/12/00

   o ZMP - How embarrassing... I'd discovered that ZMP still crashes when
       exporting large messages (eg., uuencoded files). I've found and
       fixed another occurrence of having calculated the size of a
       message using a UWORD - hence, if the message is more than 64KB,
       you get a memory overrun and ..  boom. Gurucity.

23/12/00

   o devkit - zeus.fd SignalWatchers() was incorrect. Added flags (d2)
