31/03/01

   o ChangeSIG - Bug in this default script caused the SIG list to stop
       at the first SIG the user doesn't have access to. Ensure
       "BuildList" looks something like this:

      end
      else do
         /* rc>=5 when there are no more sigs.
          * no other RC is valid. 2 means no
          * access, do not exit on this.
          */
         if SIGRC >= 5 then
            fin = 1
      end

      n = n + 1

